SURFACE SUMMARY (parity with the web source)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Four GlassPanel cards in a responsive grid (web `grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4`):
    1. Vehicles            — car.fill (cyan/accent)   value = vehicles.length
    2. Avg Battery         — battery.100 (green)       value = round(mean battery)%   (empty-guard -> 0)
    3. Total Range         — gauge needle (purple)     value = round(convertDistanceFromSI(Σ rated_range, unit)); unit appended to label
    4. Charging / Online   — bolt.fill (amber)         value = chargingCount (green) + " / " + onlineCount (muted)
  SI: Σ rated_range is meters (Phase-42); converted at the display boundary via the shared
  FleetUnits.distanceFromSI (km /1000, mi /1609.344, ft /0.3048) — reused, not re-declared.
  Data bound through FleetSummaryViewModel (P1/S8 state-holder seam); no HTTP in the view.
  States rendered (prompt): loading (skeleton) · empty (ContentUnavailableView) · error (retry) ·
  content · stale (banner + one guarded auto-refresh) · offline (cached cards + banner).
  i18n: every label via the P1/S10 facade (table "FleetSummary"); 4 web keys carried verbatim
  (fleet.vehicles/avgBattery/totalRange/chargingOnline) + native envelope/a11y keys.
  Telemetry: emits `view.opened` surface="FleetSummary" once on first appear (P1/S11).
  Accessibility: per-tile combined labels (with unit + "/ N" detail), container summary, Dynamic
  Type (minimumScaleFactor), reduce-motion honored via the shared TS components.

